#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_admission
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_school_scholarship_admission.field_school_scholarship_award__admission_id
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:ssi_school_scholarship_admission.selection__school_scholarship_award__source_type__admission
msgid "Admission"
msgstr "Penerimaan"

#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_admission
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_school_scholarship_admission.field_school_scholarship_award_schedule__admission_payment_term_id
msgid "Admission Payment Term"
msgstr "Termin Pembayaran Penerimaan"

#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_admission
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_scholarship_admission.field_school_scholarship_award_schedule__admission_payment_term_id
msgid ""
"Admission payment term this Schedule line realizes. Set instead of Payment "
"Term when this line was generated from an Admission-sourced award."
msgstr ""
"Termin pembayaran penerimaan yang direalisasikan baris Jadwal ini. Diisi "
"sebagai pengganti Termin Pembayaran bila baris ini dibuat dari pemberian "
"yang bersumber dari Penerimaan."

#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_admission
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_scholarship_admission.field_school_scholarship_award__admission_id
msgid ""
"Admission this award is billed against. Must already be linked to a School "
"Student (created with Create Student Profile, or when the admission is Open) "
"and must not be Cancelled or Rejected. Required when Billing Source is "
"Admission -- enforced by ``_check_billing_source``, not by this field itself."
msgstr ""
"Penerimaan yang menjadi dasar penagihan pemberian ini. Harus sudah terhubung "
"ke Siswa Sekolah (dibuat dengan Buat Profil Siswa, atau saat penerimaan "
"berstatus Terbuka) dan tidak boleh Dibatalkan atau Ditolak. Wajib bila "
"Sumber Penagihan adalah Penerimaan -- diberlakukan oleh "
"``_check_billing_source``, bukan oleh bidang ini sendiri."

#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_admission
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ssi_school_scholarship_admission.school_admission_view_form
msgid "Awards"
msgstr "Pemberian"

#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_admission
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_school_scholarship_admission.field_school_scholarship_award__source_type
msgid "Billing Source"
msgstr "Sumber Penagihan"

#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_admission
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_scholarship_admission.field_school_scholarship_award__source_type
msgid ""
"Billing source this award is billed against. This module only registers "
"Enrollment -- extension modules add further values with ``selection_add`` "
"and override the ``_get_source_*`` hooks to match."
msgstr ""
"Sumber penagihan yang menjadi dasar penagihan pemberian ini. Modul ini hanya "
"mendaftarkan Pendaftaran -- modul ekstensi menambahkan nilai lain dengan "
"``selection_add`` dan menimpa hook ``_get_source_*`` agar sesuai."

#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_admission
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_school_scholarship_admission.field_school_admission__display_name
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_school_scholarship_admission.field_school_admission_payment_term__display_name
