#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_admission
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_scholarship_admission.field_school_admission__scholarship_award_count
msgid "Number of scholarship awards linked to this admission."
msgstr "Jumlah pemberian beasiswa yang terkait dengan penerimaan ini."

#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_admission
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_scholarship_admission.field_school_admission_payment_term__scholarship_amount_deducted_planned
msgid ""
"Planned amount of the schedule lines that are already Realized: the sum of "
"their Amount Planned. Compare with Scholarship Deducted to see the "
"difference between plan and actual deduction."
msgstr ""
"Jumlah direncanakan dari baris jadwal yang sudah Terealisasi: total Jumlah "
"Direncanakan-nya. Bandingkan dengan Beasiswa Terpotong untuk melihat selisih "
"antara rencana dan potongan aktual."

#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_admission
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ssi_school_scholarship_admission.school_admission_payment_term_view_form_embedded
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ssi_school_scholarship_admission.school_admission_view_form
