#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_admission
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_school_scholarship_admission.field_school_admission__amount_scholarship_cash
msgid "Scholarship Cash"
msgstr "Beasiswa Tunai"

#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_admission
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_scholarship_admission.field_school_admission__amount_scholarship_disbursed
msgid ""
"Scholarship Cash already paid out: the sum of Amount Realized of the "
"Realized Cash schedule lines."
msgstr ""
"Beasiswa Tunai yang sudah dibayarkan: total Jumlah Terealisasi dari baris "
"jadwal Tunai yang Terealisasi."

#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_admission
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_scholarship_admission.field_school_admission__amount_scholarship_undisbursed
msgid ""
"Scholarship Cash still waiting to be paid out: the sum of Amount Planned of "
"the Scheduled Cash schedule lines of Open or Done awards."
msgstr ""
"Beasiswa Tunai yang masih menunggu dibayarkan: total Jumlah Direncanakan "
"dari baris jadwal Tunai yang Terjadwal milik pemberian berstatus Terbuka "
"atau Selesai."

#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_admission
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_school_scholarship_admission.field_school_admission__amount_scholarship_deducted
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_school_scholarship_admission.field_school_admission_payment_term__scholarship_amount_deducted
msgid "Scholarship Deducted"
msgstr "Beasiswa Terpotong"

#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_admission
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_school_scholarship_admission.field_school_admission_payment_term__scholarship_amount_deducted_planned
msgid "Scholarship Deducted (Planned)"
msgstr "Beasiswa Terpotong (Direncanakan)"

#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_admission
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_school_scholarship_admission.field_school_admission__amount_scholarship_deduction
msgid "Scholarship Deduction"
msgstr "Potongan Beasiswa"

#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_admission
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_school_scholarship_admission.field_school_admission__amount_scholarship_disbursed
msgid "Scholarship Disbursed"
msgstr "Beasiswa Dicairkan"

#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_admission
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_school_scholarship_admission.field_school_admission__amount_scholarship_undeducted
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_school_scholarship_admission.field_school_admission_payment_term__scholarship_amount_undeducted
msgid "Scholarship Not Yet Deducted"
msgstr "Beasiswa Belum Terpotong"

#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_admission
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_school_scholarship_admission.field_school_admission__amount_scholarship_undisbursed
msgid "Scholarship Not Yet Disbursed"
msgstr "Beasiswa Belum Dicairkan"

#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_admission
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_school_scholarship_admission.field_school_admission_payment_term__scholarship_schedule_ids
msgid "Scholarship Schedules"
msgstr "Jadwal Beasiswa"

#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_admission
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_scholarship_admission.field_school_admission_payment_term__scholarship_amount_deducted
msgid ""
"Scholarship actually deducted from this payment term: the sum of Amount "
"Realized of its Realized schedule lines."
msgstr ""
"Beasiswa yang benar-benar dipotong dari termin pembayaran ini: total Jumlah "
"Terealisasi dari baris jadwalnya yang Terealisasi."

#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_admission
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_scholarship_admission.field_school_admission__amount_scholarship_deducted
msgid ""
"Scholarship already deducted from the payment terms of this admission: the "
"sum of Scholarship Deducted of its payment terms that are neither cancelled "
"nor voided."
msgstr ""
"Beasiswa yang sudah dipotong dari termin pembayaran penerimaan ini: total "
"Beasiswa Terpotong dari termin pembayarannya yang tidak dibatalkan maupun "
"dialihkan."

#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_admission
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_scholarship_admission.field_school_admission_payment_term__scholarship_schedule_ids
msgid ""
"Scholarship award schedule lines pinned to this payment term. Every "
"scholarship on a payment term is a deduction (Fee Reduction); Cash benefits "
"never refer to a payment term."
msgstr ""
"Baris jadwal pemberian beasiswa yang terikat pada termin pembayaran ini. "
"Setiap beasiswa pada termin pembayaran adalah potongan (Pengurangan Biaya); "
"manfaat Tunai tidak pernah merujuk ke termin pembayaran."

#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_admission
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_scholarship_admission.field_school_admission__scholarship_award_ids
msgid "Scholarship awards linked to this admission."
msgstr "Pemberian beasiswa yang terkait dengan penerimaan ini."

#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_admission
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_scholarship_admission.field_school_admission_payment_term__scholarship_amount
msgid ""
"Scholarship committed to this payment term: the sum of Amount Planned of its "
"Scheduled and Realized schedule lines whose award is Open or Done."
msgstr ""
"Beasiswa yang dikomitmenkan pada termin pembayaran ini: total Jumlah "
"Direncanakan dari baris jadwalnya yang Terjadwal dan Terealisasi, yang "
"pemberiannya berstatus Terbuka atau Selesai."

#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_admission
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_scholarship_admission.field_school_admission__amount_scholarship_cash
msgid ""
"Scholarship paid to the student in cash: the sum of Amount Planned of the "
"Cash schedule lines that are Scheduled or Realized, of Open or Done awards. "
"It does not reduce the billing."
msgstr ""
"Beasiswa yang dibayarkan kepada siswa secara tunai: total Jumlah "
"Direncanakan dari baris jadwal Tunai yang Terjadwal atau Terealisasi, milik "
"pemberian berstatus Terbuka atau Selesai. Tidak mengurangi penagihan."

#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_admission
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_scholarship_admission.field_school_admission__amount_scholarship_undeducted
msgid ""
"Scholarship still waiting to be deducted from the payment terms of this "
"admission: the sum of Scholarship Not Yet Deducted of its payment terms that "
"are neither cancelled nor voided."
msgstr ""
"Beasiswa yang masih menunggu dipotong dari termin pembayaran penerimaan ini: "
"total Beasiswa Belum Terpotong dari termin pembayarannya yang tidak "
"dibatalkan maupun dialihkan."

#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_admission
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_scholarship_admission.field_school_admission_payment_term__scholarship_amount_undeducted
msgid ""
"Scholarship still waiting to be deducted from this payment term: the sum of "
"Amount Planned of its Scheduled schedule lines whose award is Open or Done."
msgstr ""
"Beasiswa yang masih menunggu dipotong dari termin pembayaran ini: total "
"Jumlah Direncanakan dari baris jadwalnya yang Terjadwal, yang pemberiannya "
"berstatus Terbuka atau Selesai."

#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_admission
#: model:ir.model,name:ssi_school_scholarship_admission.model_school_admission
msgid "School Admission"
msgstr "Penerimaan Siswa"

#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_admission
#: model:ir.model,name:ssi_school_scholarship_admission.model_school_admission_payment_term
