#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_admission
#: model:ir.model,name:ssi_school_scholarship_admission.model_school_scholarship_award
msgid "School Scholarship Award"
msgstr "Pemberian Beasiswa Sekolah"

#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_admission
#: model:ir.model,name:ssi_school_scholarship_admission.model_school_scholarship_award_schedule
msgid "School Scholarship Award Schedule"
msgstr "Jadwal Pemberian Beasiswa Sekolah"

#. module: ssi_school_scholarship_admission
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_scholarship_admission.field_school_admission__amount_scholarship
msgid ""
"Total scholarship of this admission: Scholarship Deduction plus Scholarship "
"Cash. Only the deduction part reduces the billing; Cash is paid to the "
"student and does not reduce it. Restricted to the Scholarship Award Viewer "
"group."
msgstr ""
"Total beasiswa penerimaan ini: Potongan Beasiswa ditambah Beasiswa Tunai. "
"Hanya bagian potongan yang mengurangi penagihan; Tunai dibayarkan kepada "
"siswa dan tidak mengurangi penagihan. Dibatasi untuk grup Penampil Pemberian "
"Beasiswa."
